flowchart TB
  U[Browser / Developer] --> CF[Cloudflare DNS wildcard + HTTPS]
  CF --> TUN[Cloudflare Tunnel]
  subgraph WIN[Windows 11 Home / Docker Desktop WSL2]
    TUN --> TR[Traefik Docker reverse proxy]
    TR --> HELLO[hello.example.com / Nginx]
    TR --> STATUS[status.example.com / Nginx]
    TR --> API[api.example.com / Backend]
    API --> WAHA[WAHA - Private Docker service]
    API --> ROUTER[9Router - Private Docker service]
    API --> PG[(PostgreSQL - Private)]
    API --> REDIS[(Redis - Private)]
  end
  TUN -.-> NOTE[Public apps only. Private services have no exposed ports.]
